# Judge7-4-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:艾玛在淋浴房<br>射杀可可后，<br>把尸体从垃圾滑槽<br>丢了下去。|#0202Trial04_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Angry_Open2,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这样<br>就能解释<br>为什么我赶过去的时候<br>没发现尸体。|#0202Trial04_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; カットイン

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这说不通，<br>希罗。|#0202Trial04_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR8,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为可可的尸体是<br>在中庭发现的。|#0202Trial04_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:如果尸体被扔进焚烧炉里，<br>那又怎么会在<br>中庭里发现！|#0202Trial04_Ema003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ヒロカットイン

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:也有可能用绳子捆着尸体<br>暂时藏起来了。|#0202Trial04_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:等我走了以后，<br>艾玛用绳子<br>把可可的尸体吊了起来……|#0202Trial04_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:然后把尸体放在中庭，<br>装作刚发现尸体。|#0202Trial04_Hiro005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL3,Eyes1_Angry_Open2,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就是为了把刚刚经过中庭的我<br>诬陷成凶手。|#0202Trial04_Hiro006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; エマカットイン

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR8,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那你的意思是<br>我在淋浴房<br>杀了她？|#0202Trial04_Ema004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但那里没有留下任何<br>能证明这点的<link=\"Objection_02_02_04_01\">痕迹</link>，不是吗。|#0202Trial04_Ema005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head02/Facial02/Mouth02>Mouth02_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"还是说，<br>你的意思是<br>我在<link=\"Objection_02_02_04_02\">其他地方</link><br>杀了可可，<br>然后只把尸体<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_04_03\">搬了过来</link>？|#0202Trial04_Ema006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ヒロカットイン

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL2,Eyes1_Normal_Open5,Mouth1_Determined_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那里可是<br>淋浴房。<br>冲洗干净痕迹<br>并不是什么难事。|#0202Trial04_Hiro007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; エマカットイン

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL13,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但如果<br>真是那样，不是会留下<br>【<link=\"Objection_02_02_04_04\">抹掉痕迹的痕迹</link>】吗？|#0202Trial04_Ema007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head02/Facial02/Mouth02>Mouth02_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你反驳得<br>太勉强了！|#0202Trial04_Ema008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


